 r←ChangeLog(space folder args);project
⍝ Desc: Takes an APL name and lists all commits the object was part of
⍝ Parse: 1 -project=
⍝ Project: 0
 project←folder
 :If 0<≢space                       ⍝ Only a project space can qualify a relative APL name
     project←⍕space
 :EndIf
 r←project ##.ChangeLog args._1     ⍝ `IdentifyObject` works out what the argument is
⍝Done
